{
  "$defs": {
    "PlatformLiveness": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Kennzahlen fuer eine einzelne Plattform (``twitter``/``reddit``) oder\ndie ueber alle Plattformen aggregierte Sicht (``platform=\"gesamt\"``).\n\nDefinitionen (siehe ``docs/runbooks/simulation-liveness.md`` fuer\nZielwerte und Herleitung):\n\n- L1 ``actions_per_agent_round``: reale Aktionen (ohne Startposts aus\n  Runde 0, ``DO_NOTHING``, ``REFRESH``, ``SIGN_UP``) geteilt durch\n  (Agentenzahl * abgeschlossene Runden).\n- L2 ``active_agent_share_median``: Median je Runde von\n  (aktive Agenten in dieser Runde / Agentenzahl). \"Aktiv\" = mindestens\n  eine geloggte Aktion (inkl. ``DO_NOTHING``) in dieser Runde.\n- L3 ``own_post_share``: (``CREATE_POST`` + ``QUOTE_POST``, ohne\n  Startposts) / (``CREATE_POST`` + ``CREATE_COMMENT`` + ``QUOTE_POST`` +\n  ``REPOST``, ohne Startposts).\n- L4 ``mutual_pair_share`` / ``max_chain_length``: gerichteter\n  Reaktionsgraph (Kante Akteur -> Zielautor, Ziel ueber\n  ``post_id``/``comment_id``/``quoted_id``/``reposted_id`` aufgeloest).\n  ``mutual_pair_share`` = Paare mit Kanten in beide Richtungen / Paare\n  mit mindestens einer Kante. ``max_chain_length`` = laengster simple\n  Pfad in diesem Graphen (Kantenzahl).\n- L5 ``rejection_share``: ``DISLIKE_POST`` + ``DISLIKE_COMMENT`` /\n  alle Like-/Dislike-Aktionen. ``contra_reply_share`` bleibt in diesem\n  Slice ``None`` (braeuchte Stance-/Sentiment-Klassifikation, out of\n  scope) \u2014 immer mit Note.\n- L7 ``seed_echo_share``: Anteil eigener Post-/Quote-Aktionen (ohne\n  Startposts), deren Inhalt eine Zahl aus dem Seed-Dokument woertlich\n  oder eine woertliche Tokenfolge von mindestens 8 Woertern aus dem Seed\n  enthaelt. Nur mit ``--seed``, sonst ``None``.\n- L8 ``duplicate_log_lines`` / ``round_fill_share``: Byte-identische\n  Log-Zeilen (Altlauf-Indikator, siehe #1713 Slice S1) bzw. Anteil der\n  Runden 1..max mit vollstaendigem ``round_start``/``round_end``-Paar.",
      "properties": {
        "action_type_counts": {
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "title": "Action Type Counts",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "actions_per_agent_round": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Actions Per Agent Round"
        },
        "active_agent_share_median": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Active Agent Share Median"
        },
        "contra_reply_share": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Contra Reply Share"
        },
        "data_quality_notes": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Data Quality Notes",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "duplicate_log_lines": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Duplicate Log Lines"
        },
        "max_chain_length": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Max Chain Length"
        },
        "mutual_pair_share": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Mutual Pair Share"
        },
        "own_post_share": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Own Post Share"
        },
        "platform": {
          "title": "Platform",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "rejection_share": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Rejection Share"
        },
        "round_fill_share": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Round Fill Share"
        },
        "seed_echo_share": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Seed Echo Share"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "platform"
      ],
      "title": "PlatformLiveness",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "$id": "https://alexle135.de/schemas/simulation-liveness-report.schema.json",
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "Ergebnis von ``sim_liveness_metrics.py <run_dir>``.",
  "properties": {
    "agent_count": {
      "title": "Agent Count",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "overall": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/PlatformLiveness"
    },
    "per_platform": {
      "additionalProperties": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/PlatformLiveness"
      },
      "title": "Per Platform",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "platforms": {
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "title": "Platforms",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "rounds_completed": {
      "title": "Rounds Completed",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "runner_status": {
      "title": "Runner Status",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "sim_id": {
      "title": "Sim Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "wall_clock_seconds": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "number"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Wall Clock Seconds"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "sim_id",
    "platforms",
    "agent_count",
    "rounds_completed",
    "runner_status",
    "overall"
  ],
  "title": "SimulationLivenessReport",
  "type": "object"
}
